===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Darkness Ablaze|Bounsweet|14}} from the {{TCG|Darkness Ablaze}} expansion.
*'''Flop''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Team Rocket|Magikarp|47}} from the {{TCG|Team Rocket}} expansion.
